{"id":"purple-grape","name":{"en":"Purple Grape","ja":"紫ぶどう"},"desc":{"en":"An odd strain of grapes with pointed tips. The skin is sweeter than the actual fruit. It's best to wash it and then eat it whole.","ja":"先端が尖った、変わった形をしたぶどう。皮 が厚くて実が少ないが、実は皮の方が甘くて 美味しい。なのでさっと水洗いして、皮ごと かじるのが正しくて美味しい食べ方。"},"level":4,"locations":[{"id":"arland-great-plains","name":{"en":"Arland Great Plains","ja":"アーランド南方大平原"}},{"id":"silver-lands","name":{"en":"Silver Lands","ja":"白銀の大地"}},{"id":"golden-plains","name":{"en":"Golden Plains","ja":"黄金平原"},"parent":"arland-great-plains"}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"seasoning","name":{"en":"(Seasoning)","ja":"（調味料）"},"icon":"totori-category-seasoning"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（食材・野菜）"},"icon":"totori-category-vegetable"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":88}